Project: Nexus AI

Architecture:
- Modular architecture
- SOLID principles
- Clean Architecture
- Plugin-based intelligence modules
- Runtime must remain independent

Coding Standards:
- Python 3.12+
- PEP8
- Google-style docstrings
- 100% type hints
- Thread-safe implementations
- Production-ready code

Rules:
- Never modify Runtime unless explicitly instructed.
- Intelligence modules must integrate through the Intelligence Framework.
- Reuse existing components before creating new ones.
- Write comprehensive pytest tests.
- Prefer composition over inheritance.
- Preserve backward compatibility.